"The System assigns a class at random, based on the Triplanetary Government's requests."
"Assignment has nothing to do with the soul; it is the next class on the distribution list."
"Many selectees weep and pray over trade decisions needlessly."
"Classes do not run in families; each child's class is random."
"Once affixed, a class assignment is immutable."
"Gorgon holds there is no such thing as a weak class, only situationally weak ones."
